"the download URL for the entire model as a COMBINE archive. Returns "
"download URL and file metadata. Use this to access model files for "
"simulation software (COPASI, CellDesigner, etc.). Specify filename "
"parameter to download a specific file, or omit to get the COMBINE archive"
" containing all files. Find model IDs using biomodels\\_search."
